---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { seller, sellerIdentity } from '../data/seller';
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy | Raising Noble"><section class="wrap sec prose"><p class="kicker">Legal</p><h1 class="h1">Privacy policy</h1><p class="stamp">Last updated: 5 September 2026</p><h2>Who we are</h2><p>{sellerIdentity} We handle personal information under the Australian Privacy Act and Australian Privacy Principles.</p><h2>What we collect</h2><p>We collect email addresses, order details, download logs (including a hashed IP), gift card details, contact messages and newsletter subscriptions. Newsletters use double opt-in and every email includes an unsubscribe link.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>Stripe processes payments; we never see card numbers. Resend sends email. Cloudflare provides hosting and cookieless analytics. There are no advertising trackers. We use one essential cookie for download sign-in.</p><h2>Retention and your rights</h2><p>Orders are retained for seven years for tax records. Magic links expire after 15 minutes. You can ask to access or correct your information, or complain to the OAIC. Contact {seller.privacyEmail}.</p></section></Layout>
